Third-party notices
===================

syntaxes/ruby.tmLanguage.json

The Ruby TextMate grammar comes from microsoft/vscode (extensions/ruby), which converts it from
Shopify/ruby-lsp (commit e044408a069f43c892143f19c389628eebffbd01, vscode/grammars/ruby.cson.json).
That grammar was adapted from rubyide/vscode-ruby, atom/language-ruby and the TextMate Ruby bundle
(textmate/ruby.tmbundle). The licenses of these components are reproduced below (from
extensions/ruby/cgmanifest.json and the upstream repositories).

